1845
02:15:51.917 --> 02:15:54.708
من لەدەستم دا کاتێک تەلەفۆنت بۆ کرد
"مامە" لەبەردەم هەمووان!

1846
02:15:55.125 --> 02:15:57.167
هێی! ئەمە چیە؟

1847
02:15:57.500 --> 02:16:00.500
ئایا بەڕاستی بەو شێوەیە مامەڵە لەگەڵ کەسێک دەکەیت
کێ کچەکەتی ڕزگار کرد؟

1848
02:16:00.583 --> 02:16:02.333
چی؟ ئەو ڕزگاری کردووە؟

1849
02:16:02.583 --> 02:16:04.875
ئەو بە دوای دەرفەتێکی لەو جۆرەدا دەگەڕا.

1850
02:16:05.458 --> 02:16:06.500
دەرفەتێک هاتە پێشەوە،

1851
02:16:07.000 --> 02:16:09.934
و نەک هەر وەک ژنێک جل و بەرگی لەبەر دەکرد،
بەڵام ڕۆڵی مامیشی بینیوە.

1852
02:16:09.958 --> 02:16:12.083
ئەو وەک...
ئەو کەسەیە کە ڕزگاری کردووە.

1853
02:16:12.792 --> 02:16:14.083
هێی پیاوی گەورە!

1854
02:16:14.167 --> 02:16:17.208
- هێی...
- ئایا هەموو ئەمانە لای تۆ لە دراما دەچێت؟

1855
02:16:17.792 --> 02:16:18.792
نەک تەنها کچەکەت.

1856
02:16:18.917 --> 02:16:22.042
هاوسەرەکەم پاشەکەوتی دەکرد
هەر ژنێک لە دۆخێکی وادا بێت!

1857
02:16:22.417 --> 02:16:23.750
ئەوە بنەمای ئەوە.

1858
02:16:24.250 --> 02:16:26.167
بە قسەکانت هەندێک مانای هەبێت.
چ ژیانێکە!

1859
02:16:26.250 --> 02:16:29.417
- سریڤالی، ڕێز لە تەمەنی بگرە.
- تکایە بێدەنگ بە دایە.

1860
02:16:30.250 --> 02:16:32.625
لەوانەیە بێدەنگ بیت
کاتێک بە خراپ باسی کوڕەکەت دەکات.

1861
02:16:32.708 --> 02:16:35.500
بەڵام ئەگەر کەسێک لەگەڵ هاوسەرەکەمدا تێکەڵاو بێت،
بەزەیی پێیان نادەم!

1862
02:16:36.208 --> 02:16:39.049
دوای ئەو هەموو چاکەیەی کە بۆیان کردووە،
ئایا شایەنی بێ ڕێزی ئەوانە؟

1863
02:16:41.708 --> 02:16:45.250
هێی! کاتێک چاوەکانی هاوسەرەکەم سوور دەبنەوە،

1864
02:16:45.542 --> 02:16:47.875
تەواوی قەزای چیتوور
لە ترسدا دەلەرزێت!

1865
02:16:48.667 --> 02:16:52.000
فرمێسکم لەو چاوانەدا بینی...

1866
02:16:53.750 --> 02:16:54.875
تەنها لەبەر تۆ.

1867
02:16:56.333 --> 02:16:57.542
تەنانەت ڕۆژێکی تریش،

1868
02:16:58.167 --> 02:17:00.417
کاتێک هات بۆ لای من بۆ ئاهەنگی هاوسەرگیریمان،

1869
02:17:01.000 --> 02:17:03.583
ئەم پیاوە فرمێسکی هێنا
بۆ چاوی هاوسەرەکەم.

1870
02:17:04.625 --> 02:17:05.792
تەنانەت ئەمڕۆش،

1871
02:17:06.750 --> 02:17:08.551
کاتێک پێم گوت
بڕیار بوو منداڵێکمان هەبێت...

1872
02:17:10.125 --> 02:17:12.792
هەر مێردێک هەست بە خۆشحاڵی دەکات.

1873
02:17:13.625 --> 02:17:17.500
بەڵام هاوسەرەکەم... گریاوە.

1874
02:17:20.167 --> 02:17:21.375
هەمووی بەهۆی تۆوە.

1875
02:17:22.375 --> 02:17:23.375
Dear…

1876
02:17:23.750 --> 02:17:25.750
خۆت بەیەکەوە ڕابکێشە.
تۆ منداڵێکت هەڵگرتووە.

1877
02:17:26.000 --> 02:17:27.000
بێدەنگ بە دایە!

1878
02:17:27.542 --> 02:17:29.917
تا کەی دەمێنیتەوە
نیشتەجێبوون لەسەر ناوی بنەماڵە؟

1879
02:17:30.250 --> 02:17:31.667
کێ گرنگی بە ناوی بنەماڵەکەت دەدات؟

1880
02:17:32.750 --> 02:17:34.417
ئەوانەی ناویان نییە پێویستیان بە ناوی بنەماڵەیە!

1881
02:17:35.250 --> 02:17:37.792
هەموو گوندەکە دەژی
لەسەر ناوی هاوسەرەکەم!

1882
02:17:40.500 --> 02:17:42.208
- تۆ کێیت؟
- بەڕێوەبەری پوشپا.

1883
02:17:42.333 --> 02:17:43.542
- تۆ؟
- هاوڕێی پوشپا.

1884
02:17:43.667 --> 02:17:45.059
- ئەی تۆ چی؟
- شۆفێری پوشپا.

1885
02:17:45.083 --> 02:17:46.500
- تۆ؟
- بەشێک لە باندەکەی پوشپا.

1886
02:17:48.417 --> 02:17:52.083
لێرەدا کەس ناوی ڕاستەقینەی خۆی پێت ناڵێت.

1887
02:17:52.750 --> 02:17:54.500
خۆیان بە پیاوی پوشپا ناودەبەن.

1888
02:17:55.208 --> 02:17:56.542
هەموو ئەمانە لەبیر بکە.

1889
02:17:57.042 --> 02:17:58.042
ئەو کێیە؟

1890
02:17:58.583 --> 02:17:59.625
برا گەورەکەی پوشپا.

1891
02:18:00.542 --> 02:18:01.625
تەنها نایاب!

1892
02:18:02.167 --> 02:18:03.875
ئەمە هاوسەری منە!

1893
02:18:04.792 --> 02:18:05.792
Hey!

1894
02:18:06.500 --> 02:18:08.917
پوشپا تەنها ناوێک نییە.

1895
02:18:09.708 --> 02:18:11.208
پوشپا براندێکە!

1896
02:18:13.417 --> 02:18:14.417
- خاڵە.
- Hey!

1897
02:18:15.375 --> 02:18:17.542
بەسە لەگەڵ پەیوەندییەکانتان!

1898
02:18:18.125 --> 02:18:20.375
ئەوان لێرەن، وایە؟

1899
02:18:20.750 --> 02:18:21.750
هەموو ئەوەی دەتەوێت پەیوەندییان پێوە بکە.

1900
02:18:22.208 --> 02:18:24.292
با بڕوات!
با ئەمە یەکلایی بکەنەوە!

1901
02:18:24.375 --> 02:18:25.375
وەرە با بڕۆین!

1902
02:18:27.958 --> 02:18:28.958
Dear…

1903
02:18:29.667 --> 02:18:30.667
ئایا دەڕۆین؟

1904
02:19:28.333 --> 02:19:29.375
ئای من!

1905
02:19:29.792 --> 02:19:35.333
شێخەوات بە ڕێکوپێکی هەمووی ڕێکخستووە
شتە دووبارەکان بۆ ئەوەی لەگەڵ ئەسڵیدا بگونجێت.

1906
02:19:36.125 --> 02:19:37.208
هەی شێخەوات.

1907
02:19:37.417 --> 02:19:40.250
وەک وتت،
یەک تەن لە شتەکانم هێناوەتە ژوورەوە.

1908
02:19:40.583 --> 02:19:41.958
چی لێدەکەیت؟

1909
02:19:42.875 --> 02:19:44.458
من ئەم شتانە بەکاردەهێنم

1910
02:19:44.792 --> 02:19:46.917
بۆ ئەوەی دەست بەو ئەسڵییە بگرێت.

1911
02:19:47.292 --> 02:19:48.167
تێناگەم.

1912
02:19:48.292 --> 02:19:50.083
شتەکان سنووری ویلایەتی بڕیوە

1913
02:19:50.458 --> 02:19:52.750
بەڵام وڵاتی بەجێ نەهێشتووە.

1914
02:19:53.542 --> 02:19:56.875
شتەکان لە هەر شوێنێک بن،
دەیدۆزمەوە و لێرە دەیهێڵمەوە.

1915
02:19:57.875 --> 02:20:00.042
من دەیسەلمێنم کە...

1916
02:20:00.625 --> 02:20:01.893
ئەوەی دەستم بەسەردا گرتووە دارە سەندەلی سوورە.

1917
02:20:01.917 --> 02:20:03.125
هێی تۆ چی دەکەیت؟

1918
02:20:06.542 --> 02:20:08.083
کەی هەموو ئەمانە دەکەیت؟

1919
02:20:08.292 --> 02:20:09.833
تۆ لە تەلەفزیۆن و کاغەزدا ترێند دەکەیت

1920
02:20:09.917 --> 02:20:12.333
بەهۆی دەستبەسەرداگرتنی بڕە پارەیەکی وەها زۆر
لە دار سەندەلی سوور.

1921
02:20:12.833 --> 02:20:15.958
درۆکانتان بە ئاشکرا دەردەکەون
کاتێک لیژنەی پشکنین دەگاتە دەستمان.

1922
02:20:19.375 --> 02:20:20.583
ئەمە دارە سەندەلی سوورە.

1923
02:20:21.292 --> 02:20:22.417
ئەسڵی. نمرەیەک.

1924
02:20:23.833 --> 02:20:24.994
داکشا چیت دەگوت؟

1925
02:20:25.792 --> 02:20:27.792
لیژنەی پشکنینی...
لە پاشنیوەڕۆدا دێت...

1926
02:20:27.833 --> 02:20:29.643
بۆ ئەوەی بزانرێت کە ئایا...
ئەمە دارە سەندەلی سوورە یان نا.

1927
02:20:29.667 --> 02:20:31.458
من پرسیار دەکەم
چۆن بەڕێوەی دەبەیت.

1928
02:20:32.458 --> 02:20:35.333
من بەڕێوەبەری لیژنەکە نابم.

1929
02:20:36.083 --> 02:20:38.958
لیژنەکە دێت بۆ بەڕێوەبردنی من.

1930
02:20:42.000 --> 02:20:44.684
- کاکە بۆچی بەرەو ژوورەوە دەڕۆیت؟
- کاکە ئێستا چی دەکەیت؟

1931
02:20:44.708 --> 02:20:45.708
چی؟

1932
02:20:46.625 --> 02:20:47.667
لیژنەی سەردانکەران...

1933
02:20:48.458 --> 02:20:50.500
تەنها ئەم شتانە تاقی دەکاتەوە.

1934
02:20:56.333 --> 02:20:57.375
ئەمە تاقیکردنەوەی جەستەییە.

1935
02:20:57.542 --> 02:21:01.042
لەکاتی کونکردندا،
ئەگەر پاودەرەکە تا کۆتایی سوور بوو ئەوا...

1936
02:21:01.125 --> 02:21:02.726
- بەڵێ.
- سەندەلی سوورە لەسەدا سەد.

1937
02:21:02.750 --> 02:21:04.143
ڕەنگی نەوتی سپی نەگۆڕا...

1938
02:21:04.167 --> 02:21:06.167
- واتە دارە سەندەلی سووری ئەسڵییە.
- Okay.

1939
02:21:06.417 --> 02:21:08.625
ئەوان بڕوانامەی پێدەدەن

1940
02:21:09.208 --> 02:21:10.309
بە ڕاگەیاندنی ئەوەی کە تەواوی شتەکان
دارە سەندەلی سوورە.

1941
02:21:10.333 --> 02:21:12.958
هەموو نمونەکانی دار سەندەلی سوور
هێنراوەکان لە پلەی Aن.

1942
02:21:13.542 --> 02:21:17.250
هەموو تیمەکەمان باوەڕیان وایە
کە دارە سەندەلی سوورەکە پلەی A یە.

1943
02:21:18.000 --> 02:21:19.750
تا ئەو کاتەی شتە ئەسڵیەکان دەدۆزینەوە،

1944
02:21:20.292 --> 02:21:22.932
ئێمە وایان لێدەکەین باوەڕیان پێبکەن
کە ئەمە دارە سەندەلی سووری ئەسڵییە.

1945
02:21:23.208 --> 02:21:26.208
<i>ئەو دارە سەندەلی سوورەی دەستی بەسەردا گیراوە دەبێتە...
بەپێی ڕێکارەکان زیاد دەکرێت.</i>

1946
02:21:26.458 --> 02:21:28.583
<i>ئێمە بڕە پارەکە ڕادەستی دەکەین
بۆ خەزێنەی حکومەت.</i>

1947
02:21:28.667 --> 02:21:30.434
- کاکە، پراتاپ ڕێدی لەسەر هێڵەکە.
<i>- دەستت بەسەر دار سەندەلی سووردا گرت کە بەهای کرۆرەکانە!</i>

1948
02:21:30.458 --> 02:21:33.268
<i>- کاکە ئەمە هەواڵێکی گەورەیە!
- کاکە ئەمە چەندە هەست بە شانازی دەکات؟</i>

1949
02:21:33.292 --> 02:21:34.292
بەڵێ برام. پێم بڵێ.

1950
02:21:34.333 --> 02:21:36.292
ئەم سێرکە لە تیڤی چییە سیداپا؟

1951
02:21:36.958 --> 02:21:38.279
<i>پۆلیس دەستی بەسەر ئەو شتانەدا گرتووە.</i>

1952
02:21:38.917 --> 02:21:40.250
ئێستا پارەکە چۆن دەهێنی؟

1953
02:21:40.833 --> 02:21:42.375
پێشتر لەگەڵ هەمووان قسەم کردووە کاکە.

1954
02:21:42.750 --> 02:21:43.750
نەخێر برام.

1955
02:21:43.917 --> 02:21:45.875
پوشپا وای وت
بارەکە پێشتر گەیشتوە.

1956
02:21:46.208 --> 02:21:47.393
ئەوە ئەوەیە کە من لێی تێناگەم.

1957
02:21:47.417 --> 02:21:48.458
Pushpa!

1958
02:21:49.583 --> 02:21:51.750
ئۆفیسی ئاهەنگەکانی پراجا چایتانیا

1959
02:21:52.292 --> 02:21:53.708
ئەو کولییە چی لەدەست دەدات؟

1960
02:21:53.792 --> 02:21:56.167
- کامێراکە دابگیرسێنە!
- ئامادەبە!

1961
02:21:57.000 --> 02:21:58.559
ئەگەر شتێک بە هەڵەدا چوو،
تەنها بە تەقەمەنیەوە دەچێتە دارستان.

1962
02:21:58.583 --> 02:22:01.042
Pushpa…

1963
02:22:01.500 --> 02:22:03.708
خەڵک تەنانەت بەخشندەیش نابن
ئاڵای حزبەکەمان.

1964
02:22:19.417 --> 02:22:20.500
پوشپا لێرەدایە.

1965
02:22:20.917 --> 02:22:22.625
لەگەڵ پوشپا قسە دەکەم و دەگەڕێمەوە بۆت.

1966
02:22:43.375 --> 02:22:46.256
ئەمە چییە پوشپا؟ شێخەوات چییە
قسەکردن لەبەردەم ڕۆژنامەکاندا؟

1967
02:22:46.417 --> 02:22:47.500
ئەوە ڕاستی نییە.

1968
02:22:47.750 --> 02:22:50.018
ئەو سەلماندوویەتی کە ئەوەی دەستی بەسەردا گرتووە
لە ڕاستیدا دارە سەندەلی سوورە.

1969
02:22:50.042 --> 02:22:51.250
نەخێر، ئەوە <i>ساندرایە.</i>

1970
02:22:52.083 --> 02:22:53.583
پاشان ئەسڵی لە کوێیە؟

1971
02:22:54.000 --> 02:22:55.292
لە هەر شوێنێک بێت...

1972
02:22:56.583 --> 02:22:58.958
ئامادەیە بۆ بەزاندنی سنوور.

1973
02:23:00.292 --> 02:23:04.167
چۆن باوەڕمان بەوە هەبێت کە <i>ساندرا</i>یە
دوای ئەوەی شتەکانمان نارد

1974
02:23:04.250 --> 02:23:05.684
ژیانمان بخەینە مەترسییەوە
و بەو پلانە زۆرەوە؟

1975
02:23:05.708 --> 02:23:08.184
پێی وابوو کە دار سەندەلی سوورە
چونکە ئێمە بەو شێوەیە ناردمان.

1976
02:23:08.208 --> 02:23:10.309
بیستم ئاهەنگێکی گەورە هەیە
لە ماڵی مانگالام سرینو دوێنێ شەو.

1977
02:23:10.333 --> 02:23:11.643
تەنانەت موروگانیش لە ئاهەنگەکەدا ئامادە بوو.

1978
02:23:11.667 --> 02:23:14.417
دیارە موروگان
و شێخەوات قسەیەکی دوور و درێژی کرد.

1979
02:23:14.500 --> 02:23:17.000
ئەگەر ئەوە <i>ساندرا بووایە،</i> ئەوا بۆچی
موروگان بەشداری ئاهەنگەکە بکات؟

1980
02:23:17.083 --> 02:23:17.917
نەخێر برام.

1981
02:23:18.000 --> 02:23:20.851
ئەو تەحەدای ئەوەی کردبوو کە ئەگەر شتەکان بەدەست بهێنرێن
دەستی بەسەردا گرت کە ئەو سەندیکاکە بەجێدەهێڵێت.

1982
02:23:20.875 --> 02:23:22.250
پاشان پێی بڵێ وازی لێ بێنە.

1983
02:23:30.375 --> 02:23:32.417
هێشتا لەو مەزاج "دادپەروەرانە"دایە.
ئاگاداربە.

1984
02:23:32.500 --> 02:23:34.750
وتم کە ئەوە دار سەندەل نییە.

1985
02:23:35.042 --> 02:23:36.708
ناتوانی تێبگەی؟

1986
02:23:40.458 --> 02:23:43.083
ئەگەر دار سەندەل بووایە،
ئایا من بەم شێوەیە ئارام دەبم؟

1987
02:23:46.083 --> 02:23:47.708
ئەگەر ئەوە دار سەندەلی سوور بێت...

1988
02:23:48.250 --> 02:23:49.875
پاشان یەک فلسم ناوێت.

1989
02:23:50.708 --> 02:23:51.958
چی ئەگەر <i>ساندرا بێت؟</i>

1990
02:23:52.875 --> 02:23:54.893
پاشان داوای پشکی خۆتمان لێ مەکە
لەو شتانەی کە هەمانە.

1991
02:23:54.917 --> 02:23:55.917
باشە.

1992
02:23:56.542 --> 02:23:58.125
You have the real stuff.

1993
02:23:58.958 --> 02:24:00.208
We're all very close here.

1994
02:24:00.917 --> 02:24:03.000
- Just tell us where the stuff is!
- Mr. Siddappa!

1995
02:24:03.125 --> 02:24:05.417
You guys might have a good bond.

1996
02:24:05.875 --> 02:24:08.083
But we need proof of where our stuff is.

1997
02:24:08.167 --> 02:24:09.250
- بەڵێ، ئێمە دەیکەین!
- We do!

1998
02:24:09.333 --> 02:24:11.708
- We need proof!
- Yes, we want proof.

1999
02:24:11.792 --> 02:24:13.625
Get him to tell us where our stuff is!

2000
02:24:13.708 --> 02:24:14.625
- Make him tell us!
- Make him tell us!

2001
02:24:14.708 --> 02:24:15.708
We need proof!

2002
02:24:22.417 --> 02:24:25.657
If I reveal where the stuff is, it would
be like whispering it in Shekhawat's ear.

2003
02:24:27.208 --> 02:24:28.500
That's what he wants as well.

2004
02:24:29.875 --> 02:24:32.250
He's weaving this tale
to get it out of us.

2005
02:24:33.500 --> 02:24:35.875
That sir…

2006
02:24:37.708 --> 02:24:38.708
Pushpa.

2007
02:24:40.042 --> 02:24:42.083
Everyone gave you the stuff
because they trust you.

2008
02:24:43.250 --> 02:24:44.792
As a president of the syndicate…

2009
02:24:45.333 --> 02:24:47.500
it's your job to make them believe.

2010
02:24:47.583 --> 02:24:53.500
It's difficult to get each of them
to believe at the level I'm at.

2011
02:24:55.333 --> 02:24:57.250
There's no truth in business.

2012
02:24:57.833 --> 02:24:58.958
There's just trust.

2013
02:25:00.042 --> 02:25:02.083
Things here will only happen
if there's trust.

2014
02:25:03.125 --> 02:25:05.208
If I am saying that this is a red shirt…

2015
02:25:05.542 --> 02:25:07.708
then you have to believe
that it is a red shirt!

2016
02:25:07.792 --> 02:25:09.875
- What color shirt is this?
- Red color!

2017
02:25:10.125 --> 02:25:11.458
This is what you call business!

2018
02:25:24.417 --> 02:25:25.417
Jakka Reddy,

2019
02:25:26.208 --> 02:25:27.208
I'll put my faith in you

2020
02:25:27.917 --> 02:25:29.458
and show you where the stuff is.

2021
02:25:30.083 --> 02:25:31.875
But I'll only show it to you.

2022
02:25:35.958 --> 02:25:37.250
- Hey, Kesava!
<i>- Macha.</i>

2023
02:25:37.458 --> 02:25:40.292
Call me once they all agree.

2024
02:25:40.917 --> 02:25:41.917
I'm leaving.

2025
02:25:48.667 --> 02:25:52.625
Siddappa… whoever believes that brother's
wearing a red shirt, call me.

2026
02:25:52.792 --> 02:25:53.792
Even I'll leave.

2027
02:25:57.042 --> 02:26:00.208
They hold meetings for trivial reasons!
What kind of business is this?

2028
02:26:00.708 --> 02:26:02.625
Mr. CS, what are you following?

2029
02:26:02.708 --> 02:26:03.542
Whatever it is,

2030
02:26:03.625 --> 02:26:06.167
resolve the issues
without my interference.

2031
02:26:06.250 --> 02:26:08.570
I'll initiate the process
and get it done immediately, sir.

2032
02:26:09.250 --> 02:26:11.625
What's all this in a cabinet meeting?

2033
02:26:11.708 --> 02:26:12.708
Sir.

2034
02:26:13.542 --> 02:26:15.292
Hey, Srinu.
How are you doing?

2035
02:26:15.375 --> 02:26:17.167
- I'm fine, sir.
- Greetings, sir.

2036
02:26:21.333 --> 02:26:22.917
What? Siddappa?

2037
02:26:25.125 --> 02:26:28.792
I've known Siddappa for 30 years.
He's not capable of something like that.

2038
02:26:28.875 --> 02:26:31.458
Someone else is pulling the strings
behind the scenes, sir.

2039
02:26:31.667 --> 02:26:32.708
Pushpa Raj.

2040
02:26:33.208 --> 02:26:34.208
Pushpa?

2041
02:26:34.958 --> 02:26:37.958
The boy once came to meet me.

2042
02:26:38.292 --> 02:26:40.500
He also wanted a photo, but I refused.

2043
02:26:40.833 --> 02:26:43.500
If you hadn't, the matter
wouldn't have come this far.

2044
02:26:43.583 --> 02:26:47.458
Sir, a five billion deal
was closed with Pratap Reddy.

2045
02:26:47.875 --> 02:26:52.750
Yes, sir. 110 MLAs are busy negotiating
with Siddappa and Pushpa.

2046
02:26:53.000 --> 02:26:56.875
If the goods are sold and the money
comes in, Pushpa will buy off MLAs.

2047
02:26:57.708 --> 02:26:58.976
And Siddappa will become the CM.

2048
02:26:59.000 --> 02:27:00.750
Are you implying that
I'll become the ex-CM?

2049
02:27:01.833 --> 02:27:03.353
Are you sure you're thinking straight?

2050
02:27:05.625 --> 02:27:10.250
You stirred up drama in the media
saying you confiscated red sandalwood.

2051
02:27:10.333 --> 02:27:13.667
Are you acting because they'll find out
it's not sandalwood and you'll get caught?

2052
02:27:14.292 --> 02:27:15.292
Alright, sir.

2053
02:27:16.500 --> 02:27:18.143
Let's meet again during
Siddappa's swearing-in ceremony.

2054
02:27:18.167 --> 02:27:19.583
- Listen…
- Hey!

2055
02:27:21.625 --> 02:27:22.625
Wait.

2056
02:27:25.417 --> 02:27:27.083
You've got a point.

2057
02:27:27.583 --> 02:27:29.792
I sensed danger the moment I found out

2058
02:27:30.333 --> 02:27:33.875
we were getting so much money
from the syndicate.

2059
02:27:34.042 --> 02:27:35.083
What do I do now?

2060
02:27:35.167 --> 02:27:36.958
The SP was hoping

2061
02:27:37.208 --> 02:27:40.750
you'd speak to the Tamil Nadu CM
and get the support of the local police.

2062
02:27:40.833 --> 02:27:43.125
I don't believe anything before I see it.

2063
02:27:43.292 --> 02:27:45.250
First, locate the goods
and show them to me.

2064
02:27:45.333 --> 02:27:47.333
I'll believe it then.
Where are the goods?

2065
02:27:47.458 --> 02:27:50.208
The only person who knows
the location of the goods is Jakka Reddy.

2066
02:27:52.542 --> 02:27:54.167
We followed him.

2067
02:27:56.333 --> 02:27:58.625
We got to know
that the goods are in Rameshwaram.

2068
02:27:58.792 --> 02:28:02.042
RAMESHWARAM
TAMIL NADU

2069
02:28:02.250 --> 02:28:05.167
We need to seize it
before it crosses the country.

2070
02:28:09.542 --> 02:28:13.000
MP sir! I'm in Rameshwaram,
and the goods are safe.

2071
02:28:13.458 --> 02:28:15.917
- Tell our syndicate members not to worry.
- Jakka Reddy!

2072
02:28:16.708 --> 02:28:17.708
Come.

2073
02:28:17.833 --> 02:28:19.000
- I'll call you back.
- Hey!

2074
02:28:20.208 --> 02:28:21.208
Come.

2075
02:28:22.375 --> 02:28:23.667
What are they saying?

2076
02:28:24.375 --> 02:28:27.208
Sri Lanka, 18 kilometers!

2077
02:28:29.458 --> 02:28:30.625
Eighteen kilometers!

2078
02:28:31.458 --> 02:28:33.667
We'll go, right?
That close.

2079
02:28:45.958 --> 02:28:46.958
POLICE

2080
02:28:53.708 --> 02:28:55.125
Move! Get out of the way!

2081
02:29:13.167 --> 02:29:14.500
Did Charlie come into contact?

2082
02:29:15.208 --> 02:29:17.625
No, sir. His phone has been
switched off since morning.

2083
02:29:31.542 --> 02:29:33.167
- What are you searching for?
- Sir?

2084
02:29:35.375 --> 02:29:36.833
Not small fish.

2085
02:29:37.375 --> 02:29:39.625
What I need is a whale!

2086
02:29:39.875 --> 02:29:42.042
- Alpha Three calling.
- Did you find something?

2087
02:29:42.500 --> 02:29:44.083
Check everywhere.

2088
02:29:44.292 --> 02:29:46.059
There's nothing other than
fishing nets in these boats, sir.

2089
02:29:46.083 --> 02:29:47.875
There's nothing in this boat either.

2090
02:29:47.958 --> 02:29:48.958
- Mr. Kupparaju.
- Sir.

2091
02:29:58.458 --> 02:30:00.083
What is an Arabic container doing here?

2092
02:30:04.333 --> 02:30:05.458
- Mr. Kupparaju.
- Sir.

2093
02:30:05.875 --> 02:30:08.083
Do you see that container in the distance?

2094
02:30:08.500 --> 02:30:10.125
- Yes, sir.
- Ask them to check it.

2095
02:30:11.583 --> 02:30:13.000
Ponnusami come in.

2096
02:30:21.792 --> 02:30:23.500
Sir. There's nothing boxes in here.

2097
02:30:23.583 --> 02:30:24.625
Check it thoroughly.

2098
02:30:44.125 --> 02:30:46.250
Don't let that car escape. Stop it.

2099
02:30:46.333 --> 02:30:47.375
Hey, come this way.

2100
02:30:47.917 --> 02:30:49.792
Come on, guys.
Come on.

2101
02:31:05.583 --> 02:31:08.500
These guys are all here.
That means the stuff is here as well.

2102
02:31:08.875 --> 02:31:11.458
We've checked thoroughly.
Only the ocean is left.

2103
02:31:12.208 --> 02:31:13.208
Let's check that too.

2104
02:31:13.917 --> 02:31:14.917
- Sir!
- Sir!

2105
02:32:29.500 --> 02:32:31.500
Hey, Kupparaju! Catch them!

2106
02:32:31.583 --> 02:32:33.167
- Tamil Nadu Police!
- Come on!

2107
02:32:42.292 --> 02:32:44.083
Sir is here. Go fast!

2108
02:32:45.292 --> 02:32:47.042
- Fast! Fast!
- Come on, sir.

2109
02:32:47.125 --> 02:32:48.792
- Come, sir.
- Sir.

2110
02:32:49.333 --> 02:32:51.417
- Fast! Follow!
- Come on!

2111
02:32:51.500 --> 02:32:52.500
Follow!

2112
02:33:15.000 --> 02:33:17.167
Fast! Come on, hurry!

2113
02:33:37.167 --> 02:33:38.917
Hey! Why are you stopping?

2114
02:33:39.000 --> 02:33:40.351
- Sri Lanka border.
- Sri Lanka border, sir.

2115
02:33:40.375 --> 02:33:41.500
But those boats are going!

2116
02:33:43.292 --> 02:33:45.309
Those are fishing boats, sir.
They have permission, we don't.

2117
02:33:45.333 --> 02:33:47.167
- So what?
- Sir! Sir!

2118
02:33:47.250 --> 02:33:48.893
International border, sir.
We could land in trouble.

2119
02:33:48.917 --> 02:33:51.667
I don't see any borders.
I see only boats, Mr. Kupparaju.

2120
02:33:51.750 --> 02:33:54.208
- No, sir.
- Please, sir! We'll land in trouble!

2121
02:34:01.708 --> 02:34:02.792
- Hey!
- Stop!

2122
02:34:03.333 --> 02:34:05.083
- Go back!
- Hey!

2123
02:34:05.167 --> 02:34:06.167
What are you doing?

2124
02:34:06.542 --> 02:34:07.542
Stop! Stop!

2125
02:34:09.042 --> 02:34:10.042
Stop!

2126
02:34:14.792 --> 02:34:18.083
You're not allowed to cross the border.
Or we'll have to shoot.

2127
02:34:18.333 --> 02:34:20.000
- Sorry!
- You better turn back.

2128
02:34:20.458 --> 02:34:22.333
- You guys don't have the permission.
- Sorry!

2129
02:34:23.625 --> 02:34:25.434
- We aren't crossing.
- This is an international border.

2130
02:34:25.458 --> 02:34:27.375
Turn around and be on your way.

2131
02:34:33.083 --> 02:34:35.417
Sir. The boats have reached Sri Lanka.

2132
02:34:35.500 --> 02:34:36.500
Already?

2133
02:34:36.625 --> 02:34:39.266
It was eighteen kilometers from
there, but only six from here, sir.

2134
02:34:39.917 --> 02:34:40.997
Sir, we'll land in trouble!

2135
02:34:41.042 --> 02:34:42.125
Sir! Sir!

2136
02:34:43.292 --> 02:34:44.292
Sorry!

2137
02:34:45.208 --> 02:34:46.958
We're not crossing the border. Sorry.

2138
02:34:57.750 --> 02:34:58.750
Sir!

2139
02:35:29.708 --> 02:35:30.917
What's this, Mr. Kupparaju?

2140
02:35:31.625 --> 02:35:32.745
Don't borders matter to him?

2141
02:35:33.625 --> 02:35:35.292
He's on both sides.

2142
02:35:36.125 --> 02:35:37.667
Is he some sort of lord?

2143
02:35:38.083 --> 02:35:39.375
Oh, God.

2144
02:35:56.917 --> 02:35:57.917
What happened, sir?

2145
02:35:59.750 --> 02:36:00.750
Finished!

2146
02:36:12.125 --> 02:36:15.250
- Yes. Ponnusami.
- There's been an accident, sir.

2147
02:36:16.667 --> 02:36:17.667
Accident?

2148
02:36:19.625 --> 02:36:23.292
POLICE

2149
02:36:24.500 --> 02:36:27.500
Sir, this car fell off
while they were trying to escape.

2150
02:36:37.667 --> 02:36:39.500
Sir, Jakka Reddy is dead.

2151
02:36:40.333 --> 02:36:42.375
- Oh, the other one's alive.
- Jakka Reddy.

2152
02:36:46.750 --> 02:36:48.417
- Mr. Kupparaju.
- Sir.

2153
02:36:48.833 --> 02:36:50.667
We did find a big whale.

2154
02:36:51.333 --> 02:36:52.667
- Who is it, sir?
- Hameed.

2155
02:36:53.542 --> 02:36:54.750
International broker.

2156
02:36:59.167 --> 02:37:02.750
If this rod goes
another three inches inside,

2157
02:37:03.208 --> 02:37:04.208
you'll be dead.

2158
02:37:05.375 --> 02:37:07.333
One question per inch.

2159
02:37:08.875 --> 02:37:10.292
Where's all that stuff going?

2160
02:37:11.250 --> 02:37:12.250
Japan.

2161
02:37:15.333 --> 02:37:16.958
Mr. Kupparaju, Japan!

2162
02:37:18.708 --> 02:37:22.250
How's Pushpa going to receive the money?

2163
02:37:23.083 --> 02:37:25.042
- Korasoki.
- What's that?

2164
02:37:25.125 --> 02:37:26.792
Japanese <i>hawala.</i>

2165
02:37:36.208 --> 02:37:39.667
Just like we gave Pushpa half a note…

2166
02:37:40.625 --> 02:37:43.458
once the stuff reaches Japan,

2167
02:37:46.708 --> 02:37:48.667
The Japanese broker there…

2168
02:37:55.000 --> 02:37:57.500
will take the half note from the buyer.

2169
02:37:59.417 --> 02:38:00.625
The broker from there

2170
02:38:01.000 --> 02:38:04.958
sends the half note
to the local operator.

2171
02:38:05.292 --> 02:38:08.000
Pushpa will bring that money from him.

2172
02:38:08.083 --> 02:38:09.792
- Mr. Kupparaju.
- Sir.

2173
02:38:09.875 --> 02:38:11.500
We'll be finding another whale.

2174
02:38:12.708 --> 02:38:13.708
Who's that broker?

2175
02:38:16.000 --> 02:38:17.458
Tell me his name.

2176
02:38:21.750 --> 02:38:22.750
I'll tell you.

2177
02:38:22.958 --> 02:38:24.708
His name...

2178
02:38:29.417 --> 02:38:30.458
Does Pushpa know him?

2179
02:38:30.542 --> 02:38:33.708
Nobody knows him.

2180
02:38:33.833 --> 02:38:37.208
- Only I do.
- No one else?

2181
02:38:45.125 --> 02:38:47.565
Why did you kill him
when he was about to reveal his identity?

2182
02:38:49.792 --> 02:38:53.292
If he reveals,
Pushpa will come to know his identity.

2183
02:38:53.375 --> 02:38:54.500
How would he know, sir?

2184
02:38:55.250 --> 02:38:56.458
One of us could tell him.

2185
02:38:57.083 --> 02:38:59.042
That guy would reveal it
just for one crore.

2186
02:38:59.583 --> 02:39:01.792
For two crores, this guy would reveal it.

2187
02:39:02.292 --> 02:39:05.083
- For five crores… you might reveal it.
- Sir, me?

2188
02:39:05.458 --> 02:39:07.917
Who knows? For a hundred crore
even I might reveal it.

2189
02:39:08.000 --> 02:39:10.375
Pushpa is capable of making me reveal it.

2190
02:39:12.458 --> 02:39:14.375
Sir. This guy's still alive.

2191
02:39:17.208 --> 02:39:19.458
He'll reveal if he's alive.

2192
02:39:20.625 --> 02:39:23.458
You'll listen to it
and pass it on to Pushpa.

2193
02:39:24.292 --> 02:39:25.292
And I will…

2194
02:39:29.708 --> 02:39:30.708
Mr. Kupparaju.

2195
02:39:31.250 --> 02:39:32.250
Did you kill him?

2196
02:39:32.958 --> 02:39:33.958
Tamilnadu police!

2197
02:39:34.208 --> 02:39:36.583
Big smuggler!
And Mr. Kupparaju shot him!

2198
02:39:41.917 --> 02:39:43.667
Do you realize what you've done?

2199
02:39:44.958 --> 02:39:50.333
With just one bullet, you've cut
the connection between Pushpa and Japan.

2200
02:39:51.750 --> 02:39:53.167
The load has reached Japan.

2201
02:39:53.417 --> 02:39:55.000
But, the cash won't come.

2202
02:39:56.000 --> 02:39:57.417
What will happen to the syndicate?

2203
02:39:58.292 --> 02:39:59.625
What will happen to Siddappa?

2204
02:40:02.958 --> 02:40:04.167
Sir, giving it to him.

2205
02:40:05.958 --> 02:40:08.542
<i>Macha,</i> Mr. Siddappa is on the line.

2206
02:40:11.000 --> 02:40:12.000
Sir.

2207
02:40:12.250 --> 02:40:15.042
CM Narasimha Reddy has come
to know about all this.

2208
02:40:15.583 --> 02:40:17.393
<i>That's why I've invited
all the MLAs on our side</i>

2209
02:40:17.417 --> 02:40:19.792
on the pretext of my granddaughter's
saree function.

2210
02:40:20.417 --> 02:40:23.792
They don't seem to listen to us
until we pay at least an advance.

2211
02:40:23.958 --> 02:40:24.833
The money would come, right?

2212
02:40:24.917 --> 02:40:27.958
Sir, the money will arrive on time.

2213
02:40:28.917 --> 02:40:31.750
You'll become the Chief Minister
on the date I announced.

2214
02:40:33.417 --> 02:40:35.250
If that doesn't happen,

2215
02:40:36.458 --> 02:40:39.083
this Pushpa will stop eating salt.

2216
02:40:48.042 --> 02:40:50.583
Ready a container full of red sandalwood.

2217
02:40:53.083 --> 02:40:54.083
But why, <i>macha?</i>

2218
02:40:57.625 --> 02:41:02.958
If my money is over the seven hills
or over the seven seas,

2219
02:41:04.625 --> 02:41:05.958
I'm not letting it go.

2220
02:41:59.458 --> 02:42:00.625
Pushpa!

2221
02:42:29.250 --> 02:42:32.458
Jump and get him.

2222
02:42:32.667 --> 02:42:34.167
Yes, sir!

2223
02:42:48.583 --> 02:42:49.583
Greetings, boss.

2224
02:42:51.875 --> 02:42:53.076
Do you have any idea who he is

2225
02:42:53.583 --> 02:42:55.542
and how he got here from India?

2226
02:42:55.625 --> 02:42:57.665
I'll look into it and find out, boss.
You may leave.

2227
02:42:59.583 --> 02:43:01.375
Did the cash reach our dealer in India?

2228
02:43:05.000 --> 02:43:06.333
Find out.

2229
02:43:07.042 --> 02:43:08.042
Okay, boss.

2230
02:43:11.833 --> 02:43:12.833
- What's...
- Boss!

2231
02:43:57.833 --> 02:43:58.875
Don't shoot!

2232
02:44:11.542 --> 02:44:14.125
I apologize for the inconvenience
caused to you.

2233
02:44:14.375 --> 02:44:16.417
I promise, this won't happen again.

2234
02:44:16.625 --> 02:44:20.000
Your money will be ready
by the time you go back to your country.

2235
02:44:20.125 --> 02:44:22.833
How did you ever think
you'd come this far and escape death?

2236
02:44:24.333 --> 02:44:27.292
If a human is breathing,

2237
02:44:27.500 --> 02:44:29.250
it means he's alive.

2238
02:44:29.792 --> 02:44:32.542
If someone like me is breathing,

2239
02:44:33.000 --> 02:44:34.542
it means I'm growing to new heights.

2240
02:44:38.583 --> 02:44:39.792
A grade…

2241
02:44:40.625 --> 02:44:41.917
Tabla piece!

2242
02:44:43.000 --> 02:44:44.792
The shape changed but…

2243
02:44:47.250 --> 02:44:49.250
it smells the same.

2244
02:44:50.708 --> 02:44:55.125
I smell the mud
from Seshachalam Uragayalakonda.

2245
02:45:09.208 --> 02:45:12.917
- What's this for?
- An advance for your next load.

2246
02:45:13.208 --> 02:45:14.208
Hiroshi.

2247
02:45:15.750 --> 02:45:18.458
From now on, these silly notes
won't have any value.

2248
02:45:18.542 --> 02:45:19.458
What do we do now?

2249
02:45:19.542 --> 02:45:21.042
Pushpa's currency.

2250
02:45:21.500 --> 02:45:23.333
Pushpa currency?

2251
02:45:23.583 --> 02:45:25.625
The rupee is valid in India.

2252
02:45:26.875 --> 02:45:29.708
The yen is valid in Japan.

2253
02:45:31.333 --> 02:45:34.042
This is Pushpa's currency.

2254
02:45:35.833 --> 02:45:38.375
It's valid across the globe.

2255
02:45:42.000 --> 02:45:44.250
From now on,
only once the money arrives,

2256
02:45:46.208 --> 02:45:47.292
the wood will be sent.

2257
02:45:51.417 --> 02:45:52.750
CHITTOOR
166 K.M

2258
02:45:53.000 --> 02:45:54.000
Cheers!

2259
02:45:55.792 --> 02:45:56.792
Cheers!

2260
02:46:19.667 --> 02:46:21.208
H. JOSEPH
MLA

2261
02:46:22.500 --> 02:46:23.500
Y. RAMNATH REDDY
MLA

2262
02:46:33.167 --> 02:46:35.851
<i>Macha,</i> all the sofas have been dispatched.
Only this one is remaining.

2263
02:46:35.875 --> 02:46:36.917
Who do we send this to?

2264
02:47:56.458 --> 02:47:59.333
If there's anyone I'm indebted to,

2265
02:48:00.500 --> 02:48:03.292
it was only to Jakka Reddy brother.

2266
02:48:06.083 --> 02:48:08.708
That day, if he hadn't said
"Hey, Pushpa.

2267
02:48:08.917 --> 02:48:13.292
Come and sit here.
Explain it to the MP."

2268
02:48:14.917 --> 02:48:17.625
I wouldn't have become
the president of the syndicate.

2269
02:48:19.417 --> 02:48:21.500
I wouldn't have made it this far.

2270
02:48:25.375 --> 02:48:29.000
I feel disheartened
for losing someone so valueable.

2271
02:48:34.958 --> 02:48:36.208
Knowingly or unknowingly…

2272
02:48:38.125 --> 02:48:40.833
I became the reason
for the deaths of both your brothers.

2273
02:48:43.292 --> 02:48:45.250
And that's troubling me.

2274
02:48:48.208 --> 02:48:52.375
I know, you're pretty angry on me.

2275
02:48:55.250 --> 02:48:57.708
You've been waiting
for a chance to kill me.

2276
02:49:00.833 --> 02:49:03.792
But if you join hands with me
leaving all this behind…

2277
02:49:08.792 --> 02:49:10.583
Each time the load is sent out…

2278
02:49:11.958 --> 02:49:13.542
three shares of money…

2279
02:49:15.792 --> 02:49:18.708
will reach you just like this sofa.

2280
02:49:21.583 --> 02:49:24.250
If you seek only my life,

2281
02:49:26.125 --> 02:49:27.125
Here…

2282
02:49:28.708 --> 02:49:30.375
I also brought a gun along.

2283
02:49:36.167 --> 02:49:37.208
Jali Reddy…

2284
02:49:38.417 --> 02:49:43.500
It has always been Pushpa who decides
what I do and what the other person does.

2285
02:49:46.583 --> 02:49:49.458
But for the first time,
I'm leaving this decision to another.

2286
02:49:51.500 --> 02:49:53.167
Do you seek my death?

2287
02:49:54.708 --> 02:49:55.750
Or money?

2288
02:49:58.208 --> 02:49:59.250
Decide for yourself.

2289
02:50:43.583 --> 02:50:44.625
<i>Jali Reddy…</i>

2290
02:50:45.542 --> 02:50:48.792
<i>I take it that
you only want to see me dead.</i>

2291
02:50:49.958 --> 02:50:53.583
You won my heart the moment
you chose the gun over money.

2292
02:50:54.250 --> 02:50:56.750
<i>That's why I'm giving you another chance.</i>

2293
02:50:57.417 --> 02:50:59.583
Come to me when you have the strength.

2294
02:51:00.167 --> 02:51:04.792
<i>Whenever you come,
Pushpa will be waiting.</i>

2295
02:51:08.583 --> 02:51:11.208
<i>I, Bhureddy Siddappa Naidu…</i>

2296
02:51:11.500 --> 02:51:14.083
bear true faith and allegiance…

2297
02:51:14.208 --> 02:51:20.750
to the Constitution of India,
as established by law…

2298
02:51:21.042 --> 02:51:27.417
to uphold the sovereignty
and integrity of India…

2299
02:51:29.917 --> 02:51:32.292
As the Chief Minister of Andhra Pradesh…

2300
02:51:34.750 --> 02:51:36.625
take oath in the name of God.

2301
02:51:36.958 --> 02:51:39.792
- All hail…
- Siddappa Naidu!

2302
02:51:39.917 --> 02:51:41.750
Why is Siddappa Naidu
visiting Pushpa's home

2303
02:51:41.833 --> 02:51:43.226
right after becoming
the Chief Minister?

2304
02:51:43.250 --> 02:51:44.458
Let's ask him and find out!

2305
02:51:44.542 --> 02:51:46.542
Ma'am, Pushpa is like my younger brother.

2306
02:51:46.917 --> 02:51:50.458
He invited me over
as soon as I took the oath as the CM.

2307
02:51:50.667 --> 02:51:55.167
I'm here because of my brother's wish.
Why make such a drama over all this?

2308
02:51:55.250 --> 02:51:56.875
When is the cabinet expansion, sir?

2309
02:51:57.000 --> 02:51:59.750
- Seriously! Brother?
- Tell us, sir! Who will make it

2310
02:51:59.875 --> 02:52:00.875
to your cabinet, sir?

2311
02:52:01.167 --> 02:52:05.000
- Hey, Chintu. What's the date today?
- July 24th. Why?

2312
02:52:05.458 --> 02:52:10.000
The CM said he'd come to our house
on July 24th for lunch.

2313
02:52:10.417 --> 02:52:14.708
I'm wondering whether to cook
lamb or goat that day.

2314
02:52:15.083 --> 02:52:18.375
He randomly said a date
and changed the CM.

2315
02:52:19.042 --> 02:52:20.042
You're right!

2316
02:52:21.667 --> 02:52:22.667
That's it!

2317
02:52:23.000 --> 02:52:26.250
Siddappa is the CM of the state,
and Pushpa Raj is the king.

2318
02:52:35.625 --> 02:52:37.583
Stay right there, Pushpa.
I'm coming.

2319
02:52:37.792 --> 02:52:39.792
When going to the temple,
one must take the stairs.

2320
02:52:40.708 --> 02:52:41.917
Pushpa!

2321
02:52:42.083 --> 02:52:43.458
- All hail…
- Siddappa Naidu!

2322
02:52:43.542 --> 02:52:44.667
Hey, where's that?

2323
02:52:46.875 --> 02:52:48.958
My first signature after becoming the CM.

2324
02:52:49.375 --> 02:52:50.625
Transfer of Shekhawat.

2325
02:52:53.792 --> 02:52:54.792
Happy?

2326
02:52:54.917 --> 02:52:56.417
This may sting us.

2327
02:52:56.958 --> 02:53:00.500
If you get him transferred now,
we'll lose our respect.

2328
02:53:01.250 --> 02:53:03.667
If he stays,
he'll lose his respect.

2329
02:53:04.458 --> 02:53:07.167
Think big at least now, sir.

2330
02:53:07.500 --> 02:53:09.750
- You've become the CM.
- Whatever you say, man.

2331
02:53:12.417 --> 02:53:18.542
Srivalli, you're flipping state politics
just like you flip <i>dosas </i>in the kitchen!

2332
02:53:18.833 --> 02:53:21.625
I became the Chief Minister
only because you asked for a photo.

2333
02:53:22.125 --> 02:53:23.125
Thanks!

2334
02:53:26.000 --> 02:53:27.000
Greetings, ma'am.

2335
02:53:27.167 --> 02:53:28.976
- Oh, my! What a son you've raised!
- Greetings, sir.

2336
02:53:29.000 --> 02:53:30.333
I'm not saying this as Siddappa.

2337
02:53:30.625 --> 02:53:31.625
I'm saying this as a CM.

2338
02:53:31.667 --> 02:53:33.101
- You're a blessed soul.
- Hey, you all go.

2339
02:53:33.125 --> 02:53:36.167
Wow! The aroma
of all the dishes is amazing!

2340
02:53:36.500 --> 02:53:39.417
- Hey, Kesava, what did you hack today?
- It's a lamb, sir.

2341
02:53:39.500 --> 02:53:40.875
Srivalli <i>vadina</i> cooked it!

2342
02:53:41.125 --> 02:53:42.726
Please tell me how the curry is, Mr. CM.

2343
02:53:42.750 --> 02:53:46.875
Can't you tell just by looking?
Whatever you cook is pure nectar, dear.

2344
02:53:48.333 --> 02:53:49.574
- So, syndicate members…
- Dear!

2345
02:53:49.750 --> 02:53:51.542
I feel scared of you, dear.

2346
02:53:52.125 --> 02:53:53.125
Why's that, dear?

2347
02:53:53.667 --> 02:53:55.833
Hey, what happened?

2348
02:53:57.083 --> 02:54:02.167
Dear, all I asked for was a photo,
and you ended up changing the CM.

2349
02:54:02.250 --> 02:54:03.333
What are you, dear?!

2350
02:54:03.667 --> 02:54:04.667
Dear…

2351
02:54:05.500 --> 02:54:09.333
women rarely ask for anything,
maybe once in a blue moon.

2352
02:54:09.750 --> 02:54:13.042
If a husband can't even fulfill that,
how can he call himself a man?

2353
02:54:13.125 --> 02:54:16.750
If our wives hear these words,
we're as good as dead.

2354
02:54:16.833 --> 02:54:18.708
- Right, brother.
- Big salute to you, dear.

2355
02:54:19.042 --> 02:54:21.362
- I won't ask you for anything ever again.
- Hey, Srivalli.

2356
02:54:21.500 --> 02:54:24.958
From now on, ask me for whatever
you need, not your husband.

2357
02:54:25.542 --> 02:54:26.458
Oh!

2358
02:54:26.542 --> 02:54:28.333
I haven't taken a photo with you yet!

2359
02:54:28.417 --> 02:54:30.000
Sir, you could do that after eating.

2360
02:54:30.083 --> 02:54:33.625
Man, if you don't take a picture,
the positions are changing overnight.

2361
02:54:33.708 --> 02:54:34.792
No, no. You...

2362
02:54:34.875 --> 02:54:35.958
Where's that guy, "click"?

2363
02:54:36.042 --> 02:54:38.750
- Right here, sir!
- My man!

2364
02:54:39.625 --> 02:54:41.101
- Take a photo with Srivalli.
- Yes, sir.

2365
02:54:41.125 --> 02:54:42.125
Come, dear.

2366
02:54:42.250 --> 02:54:43.250
Pushpa…

2367
02:54:43.583 --> 02:54:46.792
why did you pick
July 24th to make me the CM?

2368
02:54:47.917 --> 02:54:51.125
Today is my wife Srivalli's birthday.

2369
02:54:51.667 --> 02:54:54.500
If not today, when will you become the CM?

2370
02:54:54.583 --> 02:54:55.583
Birthday gift!

2371
02:54:56.042 --> 02:54:58.000
- Got the photo?
- Yes, sir.

2372
02:54:58.083 --> 02:54:59.208
What about the sound?

2373
02:54:59.583 --> 02:55:00.500
I got the photo, sir.

2374
02:55:00.583 --> 02:55:03.292
It's not just a photo, man.
There should be a "click" sound!

2375
02:55:03.500 --> 02:55:04.500
Hey!

2376
02:55:04.667 --> 02:55:09.208
If you press the button here,
the former CM should hear

2377
02:55:09.375 --> 02:55:10.684
- the "click" sound.
- The "click" sound.

2378
02:55:10.708 --> 02:55:12.833
What's this with these "clicks"?

2379
02:55:12.917 --> 02:55:14.476
Can't they take photos
without making that sound?

2380
02:55:14.500 --> 02:55:16.875
"Click! Click!"

2381
02:55:16.958 --> 02:55:20.292
One photo. My wife asked me to pose
with anyone who asked for a photo.

2382
02:55:20.458 --> 02:55:23.098
If only I'd listened to her,
I'd be better off today. Hey, move it!

2383
02:55:59.583 --> 02:56:01.167
<i>Snap it, snap it, snap away!</i>

2384
02:56:01.292 --> 02:56:03.042
<i>Uncle's here Take a snap</i>

2385
02:56:06.750 --> 02:56:08.458
<i>Snap it, snap it, snap away!</i>

2386
02:56:08.542 --> 02:56:10.208
<i>Brother-in-law's here
Take a snap</i>

2387
02:56:14.000 --> 02:56:17.542
<i>The buddy is here, snap it!
The dude is here, snap it!</i>

2388
02:56:17.625 --> 02:56:21.250
<i>The invitees get a snap
So do the party crashers</i>

2389
02:56:21.333 --> 02:56:24.792
<i>The good, the bad
The ugly all get a snap</i>

2390
02:56:24.875 --> 02:56:28.250
<i>Take photos with them
And stick them in the album</i>

2391
02:56:28.333 --> 02:56:31.875
<i>But the one you clicked with me, baby
Keep it hidden safely in your locker!</i>

2392
02:56:31.958 --> 02:56:35.792
<i>If these sneaky snaps slip outside</i>

2393
02:56:35.875 --> 02:56:40.958
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2394
02:56:44.958 --> 02:56:50.417
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2395
02:57:22.667 --> 02:57:26.750
<i>Stand beside me and take a perfect shot
But if your hands brush my shoulders…</i>

2396
02:57:26.833 --> 02:57:29.833
<i>You'll get smacked!
You'll get smacked!</i>

2397
02:57:29.917 --> 02:57:34.000
<i>Alright, wrap your hands around me
But if they get naughty…</i>

2398
02:57:34.083 --> 02:57:37.542
<i>You'll get smacked!
You'll get smacked!</i>

2399
02:57:37.625 --> 02:57:41.250
<i>Solo photos? No problem!
Colorful photos? No problem!</i>

2400
02:57:41.333 --> 02:57:44.458
<i>Let's even take a group photo
No complaints here!</i>

2401
02:57:44.542 --> 02:57:48.500
<i>But posting it in public
With silly captions?</i>

2402
02:57:48.583 --> 02:57:53.833
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2403
02:57:57.667 --> 02:58:03.125
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2404
02:58:32.167 --> 02:58:35.792
<i>Any pose will do
Just no exposing, or else…</i>

2405
02:58:35.875 --> 02:58:39.000
<i>You'll get smacked!
You'll get smacked!</i>

2406
02:58:39.458 --> 02:58:42.917
<i>Any angle's fine, click as you like
But if your mind's in the wrong angle…</i>

2407
02:58:43.000 --> 02:58:46.250
<i>You'll get smacked!
You'll get smacked!</i>

2408
02:58:46.750 --> 02:58:50.333
<i>Keep the photos safe
Enjoy them leisurely</i>

2409
02:58:50.417 --> 02:58:53.417
<i>Feast your eyes and have a blast!
No objections here</i>

2410
02:58:53.500 --> 02:58:57.583
<i>But if you edit my face
Tweak and morph it</i>

2411
02:58:57.667 --> 02:59:02.625
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2412
02:59:06.750 --> 02:59:12.208
<i>You'll get smacked, oh darling!
You'll get smacked, oh!</i>

2413
02:59:54.042 --> 02:59:55.042
It's over, sir.

2414
02:59:55.292 --> 02:59:56.292
Everything is over.

2415
02:59:56.708 --> 02:59:58.309
They'll auction it in two or three days.

2416
02:59:58.375 --> 03:00:00.695
If they find out this is fake,
it's the end for both of us.

2417
03:00:00.750 --> 03:00:02.430
You'll be suspended, and I'll be debarred.

2418
03:00:02.500 --> 03:00:03.667
- Mr. Kupparaju.
- Sir.

2419
03:00:04.125 --> 03:00:09.125
I just realized there's no difference
between red sandalwood and <i>sandra.</i>

2420
03:00:09.208 --> 03:00:11.000
- How's that possible, sir?
- Look here.

2421
03:00:11.333 --> 03:00:13.573
Can you tell which is red sandalwood
and which is <i>sandra?</i>

2422
03:00:13.917 --> 03:00:17.792
Hold on, sir. Both are just ash, right?
How can we tell?

2423
03:00:18.125 --> 03:00:20.375
- Exactly, Mr. Kupparaju.
- Yes, sir.

2424
03:00:20.500 --> 03:00:24.750
Whether it's red sandalwood or <i>sandra,</i>
they all burn to become ash.

2425
03:00:24.917 --> 03:00:25.917
Correct, sir.

2426
03:00:26.042 --> 03:00:29.417
<i>Sandra </i>burns to become ash.

2427
03:00:30.375 --> 03:00:31.375
Ash…

2428
03:00:33.417 --> 03:00:34.417
Becomes red sandalwood!

2429
03:00:35.250 --> 03:00:38.750
You're brilliant, sir!
Let's burn it. I'll bring petrol!

2430
03:00:39.875 --> 03:00:43.167
Hey! We got the cans here already!

2431
03:00:43.333 --> 03:00:44.792
Oh, you've already poured it?

2432
03:00:44.958 --> 03:00:48.042
You're super-fast, sir!
Let's go outside and light it up!

2433
03:00:48.125 --> 03:00:51.625
If it burns when we are outside,
they'll call it a conspiracy, Kupparaju.

2434
03:00:51.708 --> 03:00:53.167
That's right, sir.

2435
03:00:53.250 --> 03:00:56.333
But imagine if we're inside
when it's burning.

2436
03:00:58.625 --> 03:01:00.143
- Oh, no!
- They will call it an accident!

2437
03:01:00.167 --> 03:01:02.083
No, sir! Let's get out of here!

2438
03:01:02.542 --> 03:01:07.917
If I'm alone, they'll get suspicious.
So, please stay back, Kupparaju!

2439
03:01:08.333 --> 03:01:10.083
- Stay here. Please.
- Sir!

2440
03:01:10.500 --> 03:01:11.375
Sir!

2441
03:01:11.458 --> 03:01:15.375
A king's dead body
never leaves alone, Mr. Kupparaju.

2442
03:01:15.833 --> 03:01:18.292
- It takes its army with it.
- Sir…

2443
03:01:18.542 --> 03:01:20.417
And you're my army!

2444
03:01:21.750 --> 03:01:24.375
You're the dead king, and I'm your army?!

2445
03:01:24.542 --> 03:01:27.125
What nonsense! You sadistic idiot!

2446
03:01:27.333 --> 03:01:28.708
Let me go, you moron!

2447
03:01:28.917 --> 03:01:31.500
You are asking me to die, you lunatic!

2448
03:01:31.583 --> 03:01:34.333
Hey! You'll be damned!

2449
03:01:35.625 --> 03:01:37.792
<i>Catch us if you have the guts, Shekhawat!</i>

2450
03:01:38.083 --> 03:01:39.000
<i>If you do…</i>

2451
03:01:39.083 --> 03:01:42.083
Catch us if you have the guts, Shekhawat!

2452
03:01:42.375 --> 03:01:45.208
If you do, I'll leave the syndicate.

2453
03:01:45.750 --> 03:01:48.750
Catch us if you have the guts, Shekhawat!

2454
03:01:49.125 --> 03:01:51.708
If you do, I'll leave the syndicate.

2455
03:01:52.000 --> 03:01:55.208
With an ax on your shoulder,

2456
03:01:55.417 --> 03:01:58.500
you'll take on work
as a coolie in the forest!

2457
03:01:58.792 --> 03:02:02.833
Pushpa! She apologized!

2458
03:02:14.250 --> 03:02:18.042
Dear! Where did you go?

2459
03:02:18.583 --> 03:02:19.708
I'm right here.

2460
03:02:20.250 --> 03:02:24.583
- Do you need something?
- Why are you sleeping on the floor?

2461
03:02:26.292 --> 03:02:29.708
If my hand or leg hits you in my sleep,
it could trouble the baby.

2462
03:02:30.667 --> 03:02:32.417
That's why I was sleeping on the floor.

2463
03:02:36.667 --> 03:02:39.875
Take your hand off, dear.
It's time to get out of bed.

2464
03:02:40.583 --> 03:02:42.875
Why get up? Take some rest.

2465
03:02:55.958 --> 03:02:58.708
Dear, where are you going?

2466
03:02:58.875 --> 03:03:01.917
I'm going to the bathroom, dear.

2467
03:03:02.292 --> 03:03:05.625
Will you stay at home
at least after our child is born?

2468
03:03:05.750 --> 03:03:09.250
Of course. I'll stay at home.

2469
03:03:10.000 --> 03:03:13.167
I'll hand over the business to Kesava…

2470
03:03:14.417 --> 03:03:16.125
and I'll retire.

2471
03:03:17.875 --> 03:03:21.292
I'll make it my duty
to care for you and the baby.

2472
03:03:24.542 --> 03:03:26.667
<i>Macha! Macha!</i>

2473
03:03:29.292 --> 03:03:31.583
- What's up, man?
- Come here once, <i>macha.</i>

2474
03:03:32.958 --> 03:03:34.250
- Go.
- Coming.

2475
03:03:39.417 --> 03:03:40.708
- Mohan...
- Dear…

2476
03:03:42.208 --> 03:03:43.289
Your sister-in-law is here.

2477
03:03:48.542 --> 03:03:50.750
Someone kidnapped our Kaveri.

2478
03:03:53.167 --> 03:03:55.542
When she went to computer class
this morning…

2479
03:04:06.042 --> 03:04:07.250
Who the hell are you?

2480
03:04:09.333 --> 03:04:11.083
They called Mohan.

2481
03:04:11.667 --> 03:04:13.167
They demanded 20 million.

2482
03:04:14.333 --> 03:04:16.708
- What happened?
- Be ready with 20 million.

2483
03:04:16.833 --> 03:04:18.601
I'll let you know when and where
the transaction will take place.

2484
03:04:18.625 --> 03:04:20.667
Where am I supposed
to get 20 million from?

2485
03:04:21.000 --> 03:04:23.958
They told your brother to shave
his head and parade around town.

2486
03:04:24.958 --> 03:04:27.333
<i>It should be broadcast
on all TV channels at noon.</i>

2487
03:04:27.417 --> 03:04:30.417
All the revelers at the fair saw it
when our heads were shaved.

2488
03:04:34.000 --> 03:04:37.333
The entire Tirupati must
witness you getting shaved.

2489
03:04:37.583 --> 03:04:38.583
I'll do as you say.

2490
03:04:39.292 --> 03:04:40.476
Will you let go of my daughter?

2491
03:04:40.500 --> 03:04:42.833
Why? Won't you do it
if I don't release her?

2492
03:04:43.458 --> 03:04:47.708
They're talking nonsense.
Your brother has no idea what to do.

2493
03:04:49.417 --> 03:04:52.042
I'm afraid they might
do something to my daughter.

2494
03:04:53.375 --> 03:04:55.708
What is it?
What are you thinking?

2495
03:04:56.500 --> 03:04:57.821
She is the daughter of our house.

2496
03:04:58.333 --> 03:04:59.750
Do something, Pushpa.

2497
03:05:00.667 --> 03:05:02.250
- Hey, Pushpa!
- Hey, Pushpa!

2498
03:05:02.333 --> 03:05:03.958
Every family has its share of fights,

2499
03:05:04.083 --> 03:05:06.309
but true bonds are shown when
we stand together during tough times.

2500
03:05:06.333 --> 03:05:08.875
What is it?
Why don't you say something, Pushpa?

2501
03:05:09.292 --> 03:05:10.292
Pushpa…

2502
03:05:12.542 --> 03:05:14.167
Why don't you tell him?

2503
03:05:14.250 --> 03:05:17.083
Would he listen to me, Auntie?
He'll do as he pleases.

2504
03:05:17.167 --> 03:05:18.167
Hey, Pushpa!

2505
03:05:22.292 --> 03:05:23.292
Look at him.

2506
03:05:29.875 --> 03:05:30.792
Elder sister-in-law!

2507
03:05:30.875 --> 03:05:33.458
There's nothing to worry about.
Your daughter is safe now.

2508
03:05:34.833 --> 03:05:38.417
Hey, call all the university students
to Annamayya Circle.

2509
03:05:38.500 --> 03:05:39.750
Hey, start immediately.

2510
03:05:40.208 --> 03:05:42.750
Tell them it's urgent.
Boss already started. Yes.

2511
03:05:42.958 --> 03:05:45.917
Hey, tell that other batch.

2512
03:05:51.750 --> 03:05:53.167
<i>According to our sources,</i>

2513
03:05:53.250 --> 03:05:58.250
<i>the victim is Kaveri, an 18-year-old
student from a local college.</i>

2514
03:05:58.667 --> 03:06:02.708
<i>Who is behind the kidnapping?
Why was she targeted?</i>

2515
03:06:03.500 --> 03:06:06.625
<i>For more details on this incident,</i>

2516
03:06:06.750 --> 03:06:08.601
- our Siti Cable correspondent...
- Move it, lady.

2517
03:06:08.625 --> 03:06:10.333
Pushpa will take over.

2518
03:06:19.500 --> 03:06:20.583
Turn on all the monitors.

2519
03:06:23.583 --> 03:06:25.250
My name is Pushpa.

2520
03:06:26.333 --> 03:06:27.542
Pushpa Raj.

2521
03:06:27.667 --> 03:06:30.542
- Sir, the camera is this way.
- Then move it over here.

2522
03:06:31.500 --> 03:06:33.625
No further introduction is needed
to my name.

2523
03:06:33.708 --> 03:06:35.109
So, I'll get straight to the point.

2524
03:06:36.625 --> 03:06:37.792
<i>How dare you kidnap her?</i>

2525
03:06:38.125 --> 03:06:39.875
<i>How dare you kidnap my daughter?</i>

2526
03:06:40.542 --> 03:06:42.417
<i>Are you really that brave?</i>

2527
03:06:42.833 --> 03:06:43.833
<i>Hey!</i>

2528
03:06:44.167 --> 03:06:45.292
<i>You morons!</i>

2529
03:06:46.708 --> 03:06:49.583
<i>Now, listen up closely.</i>

2530
03:06:49.792 --> 03:06:52.875
I'll give you an hour from now.

2531
03:06:54.292 --> 03:06:57.625
<i>Bring my beloved back
to where you took her from.</i>

2532
03:06:58.458 --> 03:07:03.542
It should be as if she just
returned from her computer class.

2533
03:07:04.625 --> 03:07:09.458
If my child comes back
with even a little scratch on her…

2534
03:07:12.417 --> 03:07:16.167
I'll hack each of you mercilessly

2535
03:07:16.250 --> 03:07:20.667
like sacrificial goats
at the Gangamma fair.

2536
03:07:20.792 --> 03:07:26.458
<i>I'll hack you all mercilessly!</i>

2537
03:07:26.625 --> 03:07:28.905
This should play on all channels
till the girl comes home.

2538
03:07:31.917 --> 03:07:34.542
You've heard Pushpa's warning
to the kidnappers.

2539
03:07:42.125 --> 03:07:43.125
Hey!

2540
03:07:43.667 --> 03:07:45.417
Listen carefully.

2541
03:07:45.792 --> 03:07:48.292
I gave those morons one hour.

2542
03:07:48.917 --> 03:07:51.667
But you have only 30 minutes
to find my child.

2543
03:07:53.125 --> 03:07:58.833
Search every road, lane, and by-lane.
Cover the entire Chittoor district.

2544
03:07:58.917 --> 03:08:00.458
Don't leave out an inch.

2545
03:08:00.583 --> 03:08:02.458
Set up a check post at every corner.

2546
03:08:02.542 --> 03:08:03.542
ANDHRA PRADESH
POLICE

2547
03:08:04.625 --> 03:08:08.000
Whether it's a police car or
a politician's, if you suspect something,

2548
03:08:08.083 --> 03:08:09.583
stop and check the vehicle.

2549
03:08:09.667 --> 03:08:14.208
I'm closing Chittoor's borders
until my child is found.

2550
03:08:15.542 --> 03:08:17.875
I'm halting all movement.

2551
03:08:21.542 --> 03:08:25.708
Until my child returns,
the government doesn't rule this district!

2552
03:08:27.542 --> 03:08:29.167
It's Pushpa's rule.

2553
03:08:54.042 --> 03:08:55.042
Sir!

2554
03:08:55.375 --> 03:08:56.375
Greetings!

2555
03:08:57.292 --> 03:08:59.083
Why the sudden appearance?

2556
03:08:59.458 --> 03:09:02.000
Have you got any idea
what's going on in Chittoor?

2557
03:09:02.208 --> 03:09:03.625
Chittoor…

2558
03:09:03.833 --> 03:09:07.542
Someone abducted Pushpa's
beloved girl. He's burning with rage.

2559
03:09:07.625 --> 03:09:09.083
It's not just "someone."

2560
03:09:09.625 --> 03:09:12.500
- It's my nephew, Bugga Reddy.
- What are you saying?

2561
03:09:12.583 --> 03:09:14.875
The only heir to our Kogatam family.

2562
03:09:17.292 --> 03:09:20.083
He gambles with all the money
my brother and I earn.

2563
03:09:22.500 --> 03:09:24.601
He was arrested for rape recently
but was released on bail.

2564
03:09:24.625 --> 03:09:26.625
- Hey, dude!
- Hey!

2565
03:09:27.417 --> 03:09:29.125
Kesava, put Pushpa on the phone.

2566
03:09:30.083 --> 03:09:31.083
<i>Macha,</i> it's the CM.

2567
03:09:36.500 --> 03:09:37.500
Sir.

2568
03:09:37.667 --> 03:09:41.667
Central Minister Pratap Reddy's nephew
took the girl.

2569
03:09:41.875 --> 03:09:43.292
That moron!

2570
03:09:44.083 --> 03:09:45.125
Is it?

2571
03:09:45.958 --> 03:09:48.458
Then call up Pratap Reddy

2572
03:09:48.708 --> 03:09:51.792
and tell him my child
should be returned unscathed.

2573
03:09:52.208 --> 03:09:55.500
If not, I'll have to kill him.
Lives will be lost for no reason.

2574
03:09:55.625 --> 03:09:58.250
Hey, Pushpa!
What are you talking about?

2575
03:09:58.917 --> 03:10:01.333
I'm asking you
not to get involved in this.

2576
03:10:01.958 --> 03:10:04.875
But you never truly
saw each other as brothers.

2577
03:10:05.000 --> 03:10:05.875
Why are you doing all this now?

2578
03:10:06.000 --> 03:10:08.167
But my child always
considered me her uncle.

2579
03:10:09.167 --> 03:10:11.625
She must be waiting for me to rescue her.

2580
03:10:16.750 --> 03:10:22.792
She called me "Uncle" several times,
but I couldn't answer her calls.

2581
03:10:24.083 --> 03:10:27.250
If I don't respond now,
what value would that call hold?

2582
03:10:27.333 --> 03:10:31.208
Pushpa, do you have any idea
who you're locking horns with?

2583
03:10:32.917 --> 03:10:36.083
You think Pratap Reddy got to the top
just by mining?

2584
03:10:36.375 --> 03:10:38.958
<i>He buried anyone
who stood in his way to the top.</i>

2585
03:10:39.292 --> 03:10:42.708
If he decides, will either
you or I even survive?

2586
03:10:43.083 --> 03:10:44.083
Really, sir?

2587
03:10:45.917 --> 03:10:49.875
- Would it be such a huge problem?
- Yes, man! That's what I'm saying!

2588
03:10:51.917 --> 03:10:54.417
So… what do you suggest I do?

2589
03:10:55.125 --> 03:10:57.958
Let go of this matter, man.
Why get into this mess?

2590
03:10:58.917 --> 03:10:59.917
<i>Abandon her?</i>

2591
03:11:00.958 --> 03:11:01.958
Yes, Pushpa.

2592
03:11:02.333 --> 03:11:04.417
- That's what's best for all of us.
- Alright, sir.

2593
03:11:05.667 --> 03:11:06.667
I'll leave her.

2594
03:11:07.333 --> 03:11:08.333
Alright then.

2595
03:11:11.750 --> 03:11:17.250
To hell with Pratap Reddy!
To hell with Prabhu Reddy and his brother!

2596
03:11:17.417 --> 03:11:19.042
<i>Even the Central Minister!</i>

2597
03:11:19.667 --> 03:11:21.250
None of them matter to me!

2598
03:11:22.042 --> 03:11:25.500
And you? Are you some Chief Minister
telling me to abandon my child?

2599
03:11:25.583 --> 03:11:26.583
Let go!

2600
03:11:29.167 --> 03:11:32.208
If they harm my child in any way,

2601
03:11:32.958 --> 03:11:37.000
tell Pratap Reddy they won't even
find a scrap of their bodies.

2602
03:11:39.625 --> 03:11:40.833
Damn you!

2603
03:11:42.958 --> 03:11:45.750
What kind of Chief Minister is he
to ask me to abandon the girl?

2604
03:11:45.833 --> 03:11:47.292
I unnecessarily made him the CM.

2605
03:11:47.958 --> 03:11:49.458
To hell with them!

2606
03:11:49.792 --> 03:11:54.292
"To hell with Siddappa! To hell with
Pratap Reddy! To hell with everyone!"

2607
03:11:57.083 --> 03:11:58.083
Brother.

2608
03:11:58.625 --> 03:12:00.417
Pushpa is sure to kill Bugga Reddy.

2609
03:12:00.917 --> 03:12:03.000
He controls all of Chittoor.
Even I'm helpless.

2610
03:12:04.250 --> 03:12:07.250
We must find Bugga before
Pushpa does. Call your brother.

2611
03:12:07.375 --> 03:12:09.083
Hey, Prasad! Call up Subba Reddy!

2612
03:12:09.208 --> 03:12:11.958
I know his usual hideouts, brother.
I'm going there.

2613
03:12:14.083 --> 03:12:15.083
What's the matter?

2614
03:12:15.417 --> 03:12:16.417
Hey.

2615
03:12:19.333 --> 03:12:24.917
<i>I'll hack each of you mercilessly
like sacrificial goats.</i>

2616
03:12:25.083 --> 03:12:26.708
Bro! The girl is awake.

2617
03:12:27.208 --> 03:12:30.333
- If you begin, Kranti and I will...
- Hey!

2618
03:12:31.458 --> 03:12:34.500
Don't do anything to the girl.
She cannot be harmed.

2619
03:12:34.708 --> 03:12:36.750
What's up, Bugga?
Are you scared?

2620
03:12:38.167 --> 03:12:39.167
Just a little.

2621
03:12:42.500 --> 03:12:46.417
Brother.
It's me who kidnapped that girl.

2622
03:12:46.750 --> 03:12:47.667
It's me.

2623
03:12:47.750 --> 03:12:50.333
I'll unleash hell on all of you!
Where's the girl?

2624
03:12:50.625 --> 03:12:53.750
Brother, we had no idea
the girl was related to Pushpa.

2625
03:12:53.833 --> 03:12:55.958
- We just saw it on TV.
- Whose call is it?

2626
03:12:56.167 --> 03:12:58.292
<i>- Since he too is involved…</i>
- Track the location.

2627
03:12:58.375 --> 03:13:00.708
We called you thinking you'd
give the money and take her.

2628
03:13:00.792 --> 03:13:02.917
Where the hell are you guys?
Where do we meet you?

2629
03:13:03.083 --> 03:13:04.667
We don't trust anyone.

2630
03:13:06.625 --> 03:13:10.042
I want to speak to Pushpa directly.
Put him on the phone.

2631
03:13:10.125 --> 03:13:12.833
- Hey, this is Pushpa. What is it?
- Brother.

2632
03:13:12.917 --> 03:13:13.917
Nothing, brother.

2633
03:13:14.000 --> 03:13:16.042
We did it due to a dire need for money.

2634
03:13:16.125 --> 03:13:18.406
- Please don't think otherwise.
- Find out where they are.

2635
03:13:18.583 --> 03:13:19.708
Place. Ask for the location.

2636
03:13:19.792 --> 03:13:23.833
What's 20 million for you?
Give us 100 million for the girl, brother.

2637
03:13:25.292 --> 03:13:28.000
- Where do you want me to come?
- Inform the pilot to come.

2638
03:13:28.125 --> 03:13:29.042
Where should I come?

2639
03:13:29.125 --> 03:13:33.083
I'll tell you. But don't tell anyone.
And you must come alone.

2640
03:13:33.250 --> 03:13:36.375
Hey! I mean every word
I'm saying right now.

2641
03:13:36.667 --> 03:13:39.000
If I find so much as
a scratch on my child,

2642
03:13:39.083 --> 03:13:43.000
I will take all your heads without mercy!

2643
03:13:47.500 --> 03:13:48.917
Start the bikes, guys!

2644
03:13:52.625 --> 03:13:54.917
You guys go towards Chittoor.

2645
03:13:55.000 --> 03:13:57.601
Mother Gangamma will take care
of what is right and what is wrong.

2646
03:13:57.750 --> 03:14:01.292
If anything happens to the girl,
make sure that none of them…

2647
03:14:03.958 --> 03:14:04.958
is spared.

2648
03:14:05.125 --> 03:14:06.208
See you.

2649
03:14:06.750 --> 03:14:08.750
<i>Macha,</i> tell us the location!
<i>Macha!</i>

2650
03:14:18.250 --> 03:14:19.958
We are at the Annamayya circle now.

2651
03:14:20.042 --> 03:14:24.208
Mulleti Mohan Rao,
Kaveri's father, has just arrived.

2652
03:14:24.583 --> 03:14:25.851
<i>What are the kidnappers' demands?</i>

2653
03:14:25.875 --> 03:14:29.208
<i>What is he up to? What's going
to happen? Stay tuned to Siti Cable.</i>

2654
03:14:30.542 --> 03:14:32.042
<i>Brother, cheer up.</i>

2655
03:14:32.333 --> 03:14:36.042
<i>Your daughter will be back
before that knife touches your head.</i>

2656
03:14:36.125 --> 03:14:37.875
<i>Who do you think
has gone to bring her back?</i>

2657
03:14:37.958 --> 03:14:39.208
<i>- Pushpa.</i>
- Hey!

2658
03:14:39.458 --> 03:14:41.958
- Is there a sale in Tirupati?
- Why, man?

2659
03:14:42.083 --> 03:14:45.043
The elder one is shaving his head,
and the younger one is coming to rescue.

2660
03:15:34.917 --> 03:15:38.917
- Where's my daughter?
- Will you send a note? She's inside.

2661
03:15:39.292 --> 03:15:42.125
But there's a gun pointed at the girl.

2662
03:15:43.333 --> 03:15:46.167
If you fire here,
the gun will go off there.

2663
03:15:47.500 --> 03:15:49.208
- Hey, Puli!
- Brother.

2664
03:15:49.500 --> 03:15:51.042
Fire the gun once.

2665
03:15:56.667 --> 03:15:58.250
That was in the air, brother.

2666
03:15:59.500 --> 03:16:00.875
If you hurry…

2667
03:16:01.375 --> 03:16:02.917
- he'll aim for the head.
- Step out!

2668
03:16:04.042 --> 03:16:05.375
Get off!

2669
03:16:05.833 --> 03:16:06.833
Leave!

2670
03:16:08.917 --> 03:16:10.875
Pratap Reddy's nephew.

2671
03:16:12.000 --> 03:16:14.417
You can't be doing this just for cash.

2672
03:16:16.417 --> 03:16:17.708
What do you really want?

2673
03:16:18.417 --> 03:16:20.792
Look, man!
Pushpa has figured it out!

2674
03:16:22.958 --> 03:16:25.000
No one becomes a big shot just like that.

2675
03:16:25.792 --> 03:16:30.083
Nothing, brother. The boys are upset
about getting beaten up at the festival.

2676
03:16:30.958 --> 03:16:35.000
Money can fix needs,
but can it ever erase humiliation?

2677
03:16:35.792 --> 03:16:38.292
Let's beat him up, Bugga.
We'll get even.

2678
03:16:38.625 --> 03:16:40.375
He can then safely take his child.

2679
03:16:40.458 --> 03:16:42.167
- What say, boys?
- Yes, brother!

2680
03:16:45.667 --> 03:16:48.083
Why isn't he retorting?

2681
03:16:49.708 --> 03:16:51.875
Brother loves his child a lot.

2682
03:16:52.458 --> 03:16:53.875
That's why he's silent.

2683
03:16:54.583 --> 03:16:55.583
Hey!

2684
03:17:03.792 --> 03:17:06.542
That day, he was all dressed up
when he beat us up.

2685
03:17:07.042 --> 03:17:08.917
Today, it feels like a different person.

2686
03:17:09.542 --> 03:17:10.583
It doesn't feel the same.

2687
03:17:11.375 --> 03:17:12.375
Is that so?

2688
03:17:14.542 --> 03:17:15.667
- Hey!
- Bro.

2689
03:17:16.500 --> 03:17:18.542
- Go to the deity and bring that sari.
- Okay.

2690
03:17:39.000 --> 03:17:41.625
What's up, Bugga?
Did you call me to kill someone here?

2691
03:17:41.917 --> 03:17:43.208
Hey! What's all this?

2692
03:17:44.042 --> 03:17:45.375
Is this real currency?

2693
03:17:46.583 --> 03:17:47.625
- Oh, my!
- Bro.

2694
03:17:47.875 --> 03:17:49.125
What's the matter?

2695
03:17:49.208 --> 03:17:50.667
- Greetings, brother.
- Greetings.

2696
03:17:51.958 --> 03:17:52.958
Who's this?

2697
03:17:53.250 --> 03:17:54.491
Why is he dressed up like this?

2698
03:17:58.167 --> 03:17:59.167
Pushpa!

2699
03:18:06.000 --> 03:18:07.125
What have you done?

2700
03:18:07.708 --> 03:18:09.508
Do you have any idea
who you are messing with?

2701
03:18:11.000 --> 03:18:13.000
You are this close to death!

2702
03:18:13.083 --> 03:18:14.500
Get back!

2703
03:18:16.583 --> 03:18:17.583
Sorry, brother.

2704
03:18:17.917 --> 03:18:19.417
The boys made a mistake.

2705
03:18:21.875 --> 03:18:23.875
Pushpa has the entire state in his pocket.

2706
03:18:24.667 --> 03:18:26.987
Do you think you'd still be alive
if you dared to harm him?

2707
03:18:35.708 --> 03:18:38.333
Hey, bring the ropes.
Tie him up!

2708
03:18:38.667 --> 03:18:39.708
Hold his arms.

2709
03:18:39.792 --> 03:18:41.392
Do you have any idea
how dangerous he is?

2710
03:18:42.500 --> 03:18:43.500
Hey!

2711
03:18:43.667 --> 03:18:46.417
You jackasses invited your own death!

2712
03:18:46.500 --> 03:18:48.792
Hey, Dhamma.
Simply tying up his hands isn't enough.

2713
03:18:48.875 --> 03:18:51.035
Have you forgotten what you saw
in the forest that day?

2714
03:18:54.125 --> 03:18:55.667
Tie up his legs! His legs!

2715
03:18:56.042 --> 03:18:57.375
Tie them up!

2716
03:18:58.208 --> 03:18:59.208
Fast.

2717
03:18:59.583 --> 03:19:01.583
- Harder.
- He's too scared.

2718
03:19:05.000 --> 03:19:06.542
He's still conscious.

2719
03:19:06.625 --> 03:19:09.542
Hey! His hands and feet are tied.
What can he even do now?

2720
03:19:09.625 --> 03:19:13.083
As long as he's drawing breath,
he'll take ours away!

2721
03:19:13.167 --> 03:19:14.292
Give me a knife.

2722
03:19:16.208 --> 03:19:18.708
- Hold on, man.
- What?

2723
03:19:19.542 --> 03:19:20.958
How can we just kill him?

2724
03:19:22.250 --> 03:19:24.042
The real fun begins now.

2725
03:19:24.750 --> 03:19:25.958
Hey, Puli!

2726
03:19:26.167 --> 03:19:28.583
- Brother.
- Bring the girl.

2727
03:19:41.667 --> 03:19:42.875
Lift him up.

2728
03:19:59.625 --> 03:20:00.625
Uncle!

2729
03:20:01.208 --> 03:20:02.208
Uncle!

2730
03:20:05.417 --> 03:20:06.542
Uncle!

2731
03:20:15.125 --> 03:20:16.125
Dear…

2732
03:20:19.792 --> 03:20:21.708
are you alright?

2733
03:20:22.500 --> 03:20:25.833
Pushpa, I already told you
that she is alright!

2734
03:20:26.042 --> 03:20:30.458
She's exactly as she was
when we brought her here.

2735
03:20:34.083 --> 03:20:35.542
He doesn't believe us. Hey!

2736
03:20:35.958 --> 03:20:37.250
Remove her sari and show him.

2737
03:20:37.500 --> 03:20:41.792
The other day, he beat us up badly
for simply pulling her sari.

2738
03:20:41.917 --> 03:20:45.875
- Let's see what he does now.
- No, don't do it.

2739
03:20:47.333 --> 03:20:48.667
Here, I'm taking it off.

2740
03:20:48.792 --> 03:20:49.875
Putting it back.

2741
03:20:49.958 --> 03:20:52.042
Taking it off. Putting it back.

2742
03:20:52.625 --> 03:20:55.292
Taking it off. Putting it back.

2743
03:20:55.542 --> 03:20:58.000
Hey, stop!
Not up there, Bugga.

2744
03:20:58.250 --> 03:21:00.625
I think he suspects
we hurt her somewhere else.

2745
03:21:00.708 --> 03:21:02.417
- Hey, lift her sari.
- Okay, bro.

2746
03:21:03.750 --> 03:21:05.167
Hey! Stop.

2747
03:21:10.292 --> 03:21:11.292
What did you say?

2748
03:21:12.167 --> 03:21:14.042
If you find so much as
a scratch on your child,

2749
03:21:15.042 --> 03:21:18.667
you will take all our heads without mercy?

2750
03:21:34.917 --> 03:21:36.917
Uncle!

2751
03:22:06.667 --> 03:22:07.667
Hey!

2752
03:25:20.667 --> 03:25:22.042
No mercy!

2753
03:25:27.292 --> 03:25:30.208
No mercy!

2754
03:25:54.250 --> 03:25:56.125
No mercy!

2755
03:26:04.167 --> 03:26:05.917
Putting it in! Taking it off!

2756
03:26:06.042 --> 03:26:07.042
Putting it in!

2757
03:26:07.375 --> 03:26:08.375
Taking it off!

2758
03:26:08.458 --> 03:26:10.208
Putting it in! Taking it off!

2759
03:26:10.792 --> 03:26:11.792
Putting it in!

2760
03:26:25.708 --> 03:26:27.375
No mercy!

2761
03:26:32.083 --> 03:26:34.375
No mercy!

2762
03:26:45.208 --> 03:26:47.750
Hey, Kesava.
You remember what I said, right?

2763
03:26:47.875 --> 03:26:48.958
Yes, sir. I remember.

2764
03:26:55.417 --> 03:26:58.625
I'm telling this for the sake of Pushpa
and his safety. Understand?

2765
03:26:58.708 --> 03:26:59.750
Yes, sir.

2766
03:27:00.958 --> 03:27:03.583
No mercy!

2767
03:27:05.333 --> 03:27:07.167
Hey, Samba!

2768
03:27:07.917 --> 03:27:09.708
Kesava, you need to stop this at any cost.

2769
03:27:09.792 --> 03:27:11.667
Yes, sir.
Girl, are you alright?

2770
03:27:13.208 --> 03:27:16.000
Stop, <i>macha!</i>
Please listen to me!

2771
03:27:16.083 --> 03:27:18.083
- I won't spare you!
- Let's talk this out.

2772
03:27:26.458 --> 03:27:30.667
<i>Macha!</i> Let him go.
Our girl is fine. Right?

2773
03:27:30.750 --> 03:27:33.208
Please listen to me, <i>macha!</i>

2774
03:27:34.167 --> 03:27:37.167
- Uncle, stop! Let go of him!
- I won't spare you!

2775
03:27:37.292 --> 03:27:38.333
Uncle!

2776
03:27:40.083 --> 03:27:42.417
- Uncle! Uncle!
<i>- Macha! Macha!</i>

2777
03:27:42.500 --> 03:27:43.667
- Uncle!
<i>- Macha!</i>

2778
03:27:44.042 --> 03:27:45.042
<i>Macha!</i>

2779
03:27:50.708 --> 03:27:52.500
Get up! Go away!

2780
03:27:53.375 --> 03:27:56.917
CM sir, Bugga Reddy is fine.
Ask Mr. Pratap Reddy to relax.

2781
03:27:57.042 --> 03:27:59.362
Put Bugga on the phone.
Pratap Reddy wants to speak to him.

2782
03:28:11.042 --> 03:28:12.042
CM sir…

2783
03:28:12.417 --> 03:28:15.333
Bugga Reddy is going away.
Call back after five minutes.

2784
03:28:15.417 --> 03:28:16.875
What happened?
Hey, Kesava!

2785
03:28:16.958 --> 03:28:20.667
Whoever it is,
if they lay a hand on a girl…

2786
03:28:21.625 --> 03:28:23.125
No mercy!

2787
03:28:24.000 --> 03:28:25.083
Bugga!

2788
03:28:25.750 --> 03:28:27.125
No mercy!

2789
03:28:29.792 --> 03:28:32.458
Never backing down!

2790
03:28:37.292 --> 03:28:40.958
You!

2791
03:29:16.583 --> 03:29:19.667
You killed my son just for her, right?

2792
03:29:20.083 --> 03:29:21.417
I'll take her away.

2793
03:29:22.250 --> 03:29:25.042
- I'll sleep with her every day.
- Uncle!

2794
03:29:25.125 --> 03:29:26.708
Do what you can!

2795
03:29:28.000 --> 03:29:31.208
No mercy!

2796
03:29:33.458 --> 03:29:35.083
- Narayana!
- Narayana!

2797
03:29:35.167 --> 03:29:36.625
- Narayana!
- Narayana!

2798
03:29:36.708 --> 03:29:38.292
- Narayana!
- Narayana!

2799
03:29:38.375 --> 03:29:39.708
- Narayana!
- Narayana!

2800
03:29:40.667 --> 03:29:41.907
Give it to those seated inside.

2801
03:29:45.792 --> 03:29:49.083
I told Pushpa. He'll talk to
the collector and get your work done.

2802
03:29:49.375 --> 03:29:51.208
Why come all the way here
for trivial matters?

2803
03:29:52.625 --> 03:29:53.625
Hey, move.

2804
03:29:54.708 --> 03:29:55.708
No, no!

2805
03:30:02.750 --> 03:30:03.750
Come, brother.

2806
03:30:07.333 --> 03:30:08.333
Give it, I'll hold it.

2807
03:30:15.333 --> 03:30:17.167
- Auntie!
- What is it?

2808
03:30:33.667 --> 03:30:36.000
What are you looking at?
Ask him to come in.

2809
03:30:36.625 --> 03:30:38.667
- Mohan! Come here.
- Come.

2810
03:30:39.250 --> 03:30:40.583
Please come in. Sit.

2811
03:30:42.417 --> 03:30:43.875
Srivalli. Call Pushpa.

2812
03:30:44.542 --> 03:30:46.208
Lachi, bring some water.

2813
03:30:46.667 --> 03:30:47.667
Sit, dear.

2814
03:30:59.375 --> 03:31:01.708
Dear, your brother is here.

2815
03:31:03.375 --> 03:31:05.208
I mean… your relative is here.

2816
03:31:20.083 --> 03:31:21.083
Here.

2817
03:31:28.042 --> 03:31:30.417
Mother, it looks like
he won't be coming.

2818
03:31:40.375 --> 03:31:41.375
He won't come.

2819
03:31:42.833 --> 03:31:43.833
Why would he?

2820
03:31:46.292 --> 03:31:47.833
Even if he does, how can I face him?

2821
03:31:50.917 --> 03:31:52.042
I've hurt him so much.

2822
03:31:55.250 --> 03:31:56.750
I denied him our surname as a child.

2823
03:31:58.750 --> 03:32:00.125
But he lived on like an orphan.

2824
03:32:03.833 --> 03:32:05.473
When he came to see Dad
for one last time,

2825
03:32:06.333 --> 03:32:08.533
I pushed him away
without considering he was just a kid.

2826
03:32:10.500 --> 03:32:11.792
Even during his engagement…

2827
03:32:14.667 --> 03:32:16.267
instead of taking up a responsible role,

2828
03:32:17.833 --> 03:32:20.000
I insulted his birth by saying...

2829
03:32:20.708 --> 03:32:22.583
- Oh, no!
- Stop it! What are you doing, son?

2830
03:32:22.667 --> 03:32:23.708
Why bring all this up now?

2831
03:32:23.792 --> 03:32:24.792
Mother…

2832
03:32:27.542 --> 03:32:28.542
after all that I've done…

2833
03:32:29.708 --> 03:32:31.083
how can I face him?

2834
03:32:34.542 --> 03:32:35.917
Dad always used to say…

2835
03:32:38.083 --> 03:32:39.083
that he's my brother,

2836
03:32:39.792 --> 03:32:40.833
a child.

2837
03:32:42.000 --> 03:32:43.958
"Take care of him when I'm gone," he said.

2838
03:32:47.125 --> 03:32:48.125
But what have I done?

2839
03:32:49.417 --> 03:32:50.777
I never considered him my brother.

2840
03:32:51.875 --> 03:32:52.996
I looked at him as an enemy.

2841
03:32:55.500 --> 03:32:56.500
But he…

2842
03:32:57.000 --> 03:32:59.360
took responsibility for my daughter
when she was in trouble.

2843
03:33:00.167 --> 03:33:01.792
He put his life on the line to save her.

2844
03:33:04.667 --> 03:33:08.000
He fought a battle just because
she called him "Uncle."

2845
03:33:13.292 --> 03:33:16.292
After all, it's a blood relation.
How could he ignore that?

2846
03:33:25.958 --> 03:33:26.958
I'm the elder son.

2847
03:33:28.042 --> 03:33:29.042
And you are the mother.

2848
03:33:29.708 --> 03:33:30.708
Please forgive me.

2849
03:33:34.458 --> 03:33:35.738
I'm saying this in front of Dad.

2850
03:33:37.708 --> 03:33:38.958
Oh, no!

2851
03:33:39.042 --> 03:33:40.958
- Get up, Mohan.
- Forgive me, Mom!

2852
03:33:41.083 --> 03:33:43.250
- What is this? Get up!
- Please forgive me.

2853
03:33:45.125 --> 03:33:46.167
What is this?

2854
03:33:47.667 --> 03:33:50.250
Actually, Kaveri's wedding has been fixed.

2855
03:33:51.958 --> 03:33:56.542
I got the wedding cards printed
and came here right away.

2856
03:34:00.583 --> 03:34:02.143
I'm handing over the first card to you.

2857
03:34:17.542 --> 03:34:20.542
Your granddaughter is firm
that she won't get married

2858
03:34:20.625 --> 03:34:22.666
- if her uncle doesn't come to the wedding.
- Oh, my!

2859
03:34:23.750 --> 03:34:27.000
We'll distribute the cards to others
only if you agree to come to the wedding.

2860
03:34:27.333 --> 03:34:29.333
Don't say that.
It is your daughter's wedding.

2861
03:34:29.708 --> 03:34:30.583
Yes, dear.

2862
03:34:30.708 --> 03:34:32.458
He's full of pride.

2863
03:34:32.708 --> 03:34:34.417
He hasn't even come to see you.

2864
03:34:34.750 --> 03:34:36.625
There's a chance
he won't attend the wedding.

2865
03:34:37.667 --> 03:34:40.507
The Mulleti family is celebrating
something together for the first time.

2866
03:34:42.292 --> 03:34:43.500
How can it happen without him?

2867
03:34:45.292 --> 03:34:46.708
Tell him his brother invited him.

2868
03:34:48.292 --> 03:34:49.292
He'll surely come.

2869
03:35:20.208 --> 03:35:21.833
Dear, check this out.

2870
03:35:22.583 --> 03:35:26.250
"With the blessings of
Shri Mulleti Parvathamma."

2871
03:35:27.417 --> 03:35:29.583
They printed the wedding card
in your mother's name.

2872
03:35:32.542 --> 03:35:33.708
And look at this.

2873
03:35:34.458 --> 03:35:36.333
"Sons and daughters-in-law."

2874
03:35:36.750 --> 03:35:40.333
"Mr. Mulleti Pushpa Raj
and Mrs. Srivalli."

2875
03:35:44.083 --> 03:35:47.917
They got all the names right
but forgot one.

2876
03:35:50.958 --> 03:35:54.417
The name of Mulleti Chinna Venkataramana.

2877
03:36:04.583 --> 03:36:05.583
Dear!

2878
03:36:06.125 --> 03:36:07.125
Dear!

2879
03:36:12.208 --> 03:36:13.208
Dear!

2880
03:36:13.417 --> 03:36:14.542
Son…

2881
03:36:15.333 --> 03:36:18.083
- Pushpa.
- Dear…

2882
03:36:22.625 --> 03:36:23.625
Pushpa…

2883
03:36:31.958 --> 03:36:34.333
- What happened, dear?
- Pushpa…

2884
03:36:39.042 --> 03:36:40.042
Don't cry.

2885
03:36:48.250 --> 03:36:49.851
THE MULLETI FAMILY'S WEDDING CELEBRATION

2886
03:37:04.708 --> 03:37:05.708
Welcome.

2887
03:37:46.750 --> 03:37:48.708
- How are you, Mother?
- I'm doing good.

2888
03:37:53.458 --> 03:37:54.750
- Come on.
- Let's go.

2889
03:37:55.833 --> 03:37:56.833
- Come.
- Come on.

2890
03:38:47.458 --> 03:38:48.458
Uncle!

2891
03:38:58.917 --> 03:39:00.417
Can I call you "Auntie" now?

2892
03:39:08.917 --> 03:39:10.667
Father, put this on him.

2893
03:40:10.208 --> 03:40:11.583
All are here.

2894
03:40:12.917 --> 03:40:13.997
But where's the actual one?

2895
03:40:16.000 --> 03:40:17.042
Didn't he come?

2896
03:40:17.292 --> 03:40:19.612
The person isn't here, sir.
But we did receive his message.

2897
03:40:55.667 --> 03:40:56.542
What's wrong?

2898
03:40:56.625 --> 03:40:58.385
- Hey, what happened?
- What's wrong, <i>vadina?</i>

2899
03:40:58.542 --> 03:41:01.625
Your dad is dancing with joy from inside.

2900
03:41:03.792 --> 03:41:04.792
Dad!

2901
03:41:05.375 --> 03:41:09.750
From now on, we'll never back down.
